!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Course registration;
:Is exception needed?;
:v1: Is exception needed? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 == "Yes"])
:Request for exception;
:Exception approved;
else ([v1 == "No"])
->;
endif
:Course enrollment;
:Seminar group enrollment;
repeat :;
:Homework assignment started;
:Turn in homework;
:Homework evaluated;
:Is homework the last one?;
